<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0A1626' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 120, padding: '24px 64px', borderBottom: '1px solid #1E3A5F' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 500, color: '#E8F0FA' }}>第 9 章 · 遥控时间片调度器</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9DB4CE', marginTop: 6 }}>文件：ANO_Remoter/ANO_Scheduler.c · Loop_check()/ANO_Loop()</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
    {[['ANO_Loop_500Hz','2ms','ANO_NRF_Check_Event() 收飞机回传 + ANO_Stick_Scan() 读遥杆 ★'],
      ['ANO_Loop_250Hz','4ms','收到上位机数据则透传，否则 ANO_DT_Send_RCData() 发往飞机'],
      ['ANO_Loop_100Hz','10ms','key_function() / Gesture_Check() 菜单操作'],
      ['ANO_Loop_50Hz','20ms','ANO_key() 按键扫描'],
      ['ANO_Loop_20Hz','50ms','Show.oled_delay=1 触发刷屏 + NRF_Check_Ch() 对频'],
      ['ANO_Loop_1Hz','1000ms','电压检测、帧率统计、NRF_SSI==0 失联判定']].map((d,i)=>(
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: i===0? '#1E3A5F':'#0F1E33', padding: '11px 18px', borderRadius: 7, borderLeft: i===0? '4px solid #00D1FF':'4px solid #4A90D9' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: i===0? '#00D1FF':'#E8F0FA', fontFamily: 'monospace', fontWeight: i===0?700:500, width: 220 }}>{d[0]}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A90D9', fontWeight: 700, width: 70 }}>{d[1]}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9DB4CE', flex: 1 }}>{d[2]}</Text>
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 60, padding: '0 64px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E94AE' }}>飞控+遥控 代码讲解（30min）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E94AE' }}>14 / 22</Text>
